{
 "encounter_id": "00672",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mr Whitlock, thank you for coming. The booking says you want to go over how cardiac rehab is going. Fair?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. I brought my diary, I've written down everything since the eight-week mark. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Excellent. Start with breathlessness, you said that was your main thing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Breathlessness on the stairs is much better. In January I had to stop halfway, now I can do the lot at home without stopping."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. And how are your energy levels through the day?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired in the afternoons, about three days a week. I note it in the diary."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling around the ankles?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little at night, on the left. It's gone by the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any odd fluttering in the chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Twice. Last Tuesday and the week before, a few seconds each."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you had any chest pain since the programme began?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, none whatsoever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fainting or blackouts?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. Let's go through your tablets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bisoprolol, 2.5 mg, once a day. Ramipril, I think it's maybe 5 mg, I'd have to look at the packet. And atorvastatin, 40 mg, at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "We'll check the ramipril dose against your record. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I have no allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Tell me your heart history again, for my notes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had a heart attack, last summer. I have high blood pressure, high cholesterol, and sleep apnoea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any procedures?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "They put in a stent, eight months ago. And my gallbladder was taken out in 2012."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any heart disease in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had a heart attack at fifty-five."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You used to smoke, didn't you?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I stopped smoking the day after the heart attack. Not one since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I drink one pint of beer on a Friday. Under the limit, I made sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how's the exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I walk forty minutes every morning, and the rehab classes twice a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me do your numbers. Pulse is 58, which is expected on bisoprolol, blood pressure 126 over 74, temperature 36.4, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 14, and weight 84 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Down two kilos from March. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Well done. Let me listen to your chest.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Take your time. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, regular rhythm, and the lungs are clear on both sides."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good to hear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your ankles, there's mild swelling at the left ankle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's what I noted. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any trouble with your breathing at rest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. Breathing's fine at rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "You're making good progress after the heart attack. The flutters are probably benign extra beats, but I'd like to look properly."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How do you do that? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange an ECG today, a 24-hour heart monitor, and an echocardiogram to check how strong the heart muscle is."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When will the monitor be? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The nurses will fit it before you go. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. And rehab continues? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Absolutely, keep walking and keep attending the classes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll see you again if the flutters get more frequent or the swelling doesn't settle in four weeks. Otherwise carry on."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
